WEBVTT

00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:00.768
nanomaterial,

00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:02.059
blockchain,

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.684
quantum computing

00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:05.393
and many others --

00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:07.601
when combined with each other

00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:11.684
and blended with engineering
and design science,

00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:16.559
are making what's seemingly
impossible possible.

00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:20.125
So what is deep tech?

00:01:21.208 --> 00:01:27.226
I've spent the last 18 months
visiting 100 research labs

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:28.768
and start-ups

00:01:28.792 --> 00:01:33.934
from Shenzhen in China to Haifa in Israel,